            "ref": "v-fog"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p3",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "It took many years to plan the bridge. In 1933, workers finally began to build it. They worked on towers over 227 metres above the water. They worked in the cold, fog and wind. Eleven workers fell and lost their "
          },
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "lives",
            "zh": "丧生"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "!"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p4",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "In 1937, the bridge opened. Its dark orange color made it easy to see in the fog. It was the longest bridge in the world until 1964. For many people, it is still one of the most beautiful bridges in the world."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
